      "role": "FINITE SALIENCE ARITHMETIC WITH EXPLICIT TOLERANCE AND SCOPE",
      "judgment": "Four laws remain distinguishable over the declared finite arithmetic domain; no psychological winner or native admission is established. Exact allocation, role, quantized edge and row-mass checks are independently repeated. Conserved shared allocation differs between no incidental member and positive membership, then is invariant across positive footprints; unconserved positive footprints dilute it. Allocation invariance does not imply edge invariance. D100 independent zero edges are a quantization floor, not a law equivalence. The massConserved flag means nonsaturation and spread <=2% of peak, not exact conservation; independent spread is1/93. Evidence-proportional is bounded evidence sensitivity, not a verified general linear scaling law; one focal vector plus a role intervention cannot prove that. Flat stays a retired negative control; independent/shared/hybrid remain candidates. Empty prior, eta1, no decay and finite footprints do not qualify arbitrary graphs or public source ownership. Historical blocked routing is superseded only by separately scoped later qualification. Receipt has two source fingerprints, not the four paths in the writer candidate list; do not regenerate original receipt.",
